@article{Abdollahi2020Fermi,
    abstract = {We present the fourth Fermi Large Area Telescope catalog (4FGL) of gamma-ray sources. Based on the first eight years of science data from the Fermi Gamma-ray Space Telescope mission in the energy range from 50 MeV to 1 TeV, it is the deepest yet in this energy range. Relative to the 3FGL catalog, the 4FGL catalog has twice as much exposure as well as a number of analysis improvements, including an updated model for the Galactic diffuse gamma-ray emission, and two sets of light curves (1-year and 2-month intervals). The 4FGL catalog includes 5064 sources above 4 sigma significance, for which we provide localization and spectral properties. Seventy-five sources are modeled explicitly as spatially extended, and overall 358 sources are considered as identified based on angular extent, periodicity or correlated variability observed at other wavelengths. For 1336 sources we have not found plausible counterparts at other wavelengths. More than 3130 of the identified or associated sources are active galaxies of the blazar class, and 239 are pulsars.},
    author = {S. Abdollahi and F. Acero and M. Ackermann and M. Ajello and W. B. Atwood and M. Axelsson and L. Baldini and J. Ballet and G. Barbiellini and D. Bastieri and J. Becerra Gonzalez and R. Bellazzini and A. Berretta and E. Bissaldi and R. D. Blandford and E. D. Bloom and R. Bonino and E. Bottacini and T. J. Brandt and J. Bregeon and P. Bruel and R. Buehler and T. H. Burnett and S. Buson and R. A. Cameron and R. Caputo and P. A. Caraveo and J. M. Casandjian and D. Castro and E. Cavazzuti and E. Charles and S. Chaty and S. Chen and C. C. Cheung and G. Chiaro and S. Ciprini and J. Cohen-Tanugi and L. R. Cominsky and J. Coronado-Blázquez and D. Costantin and A. Cuoco and S. Cutini and F. D’Ammando and M. DeKlotz and P. de la Torre Luque and F. de Palma and A. Desai and S. W. Digel and N. Di Lalla and M. Di Mauro and L. Di Venere and A. Domínguez and D. Dumora and F. Fana Dirirsa and S. J. Fegan and E. C. Ferrara and A. Franckowiak and Y. Fukazawa and S. Funk and P. Fusco and F. Gargano and D. Gasparrini and N. Giglietto and P. Giommi and F. Giordano and M. Giroletti and T. Glanzman and D. Green and I. A. Grenier and S. Griffin and M.-H. Grondin and J. E. Grove and S. Guiriec and A. K. Harding and K. Hayashi and E. Hays and J. W. Hewitt and D. Horan and G. Jóhannesson and T. J. Johnson and T. Kamae and M. Kerr and D. Kocevski and M. Kovac’evic’ and M. Kuss and D. Landriu and S. Larsson and L. Latronico and M. Lemoine-Goumard and J. Li and I. Liodakis and F. Longo and F. Loparco and B. Lott and M. N. Lovellette and P. Lubrano and G. M. Madejski and S. Maldera and D. Malyshev and A. Manfreda and E. J. Marchesini and L. Marcotulli and G. Martí-Devesa and P. Martin and F. Massaro and M. N. Mazziotta and J. E. McEnery and I. Mereu and M. Meyer and P. F. Michelson and N. Mirabal and T. Mizuno and M. E. Monzani and A. Morselli and I. V. Moskalenko and M. Negro and E. Nuss and R. Ojha and N. Omodei and M. Orienti and E. Orlando and J. F. Ormes and M. Palatiello and V. 